    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what u mean about the risk but i feel like i can monitor myself. if i take the 1500mg and i start feeling way more dizzy or my heart starts racing super fast, i'll obviously just stop. but what's the actual danger if i just do it for like two nights to get the rhythm back to normal? wouldn't the magnesium just clear out through my system pretty quick? i'm just trying to avoid another expensive doctor visit if i can manage this myself.",
